    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up on the tenth floor of an abandoned hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your head hurts\u2014someone has attacked you, and now you\u2019re trapped. You have no idea why this happened, but one thing is clear: you must escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the hotel is not just any abandoned building. It\u2019s a maze of dark corridors, locked doors, and unexpected dangers. The way out is full of obstacles\u2014and worst of all? You\u2019re not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and Puzzle Solving</strong> \u2013 Search for keys, hidden objects, and clues to progress through locked rooms and hallways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Against a Killer</strong> \u2013 A mysterious enemy roams the halls looking for you. You must be careful, hide, and use your environment to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Horror Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Dynamic lighting, disturbing sounds, and a terrifying environment create a constant tension that will keep you on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Escape Routes</strong> \u2013 Choose from various ways to escape the hotel. Will you take the long, safer route, or risk a shorter but more dangerous route?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Mysterious and Shocking Story</strong> \u2013 Discover secret letters, and clues scattered throughout the hotel that will help you understand the hotel\u2019s and the killer\u2019s dark past\u2014and your connection to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Random and Unpredictable Experience</strong> \u2013 Every time you play, the experience will be different. The hallways, rooms, and keys are randomly placed, making each escape attempt challenging and surprising.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up on the tenth floor of an abandoned hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your head hurts\u2014someone has attacked you, and now you\u2019re trapped. You have no idea why this happened, but one thing is clear: you must escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the hotel is not just any abandoned building. It\u2019s a maze of dark corridors, locked doors, and unexpected dangers. The way out is full of obstacles\u2014and worst of all? You\u2019re not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and Puzzle Solving</strong> \u2013 Search for keys, hidden objects, and clues to progress through locked rooms and hallways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Against a Killer</strong> \u2013 A mysterious enemy roams the halls looking for you. You must be careful, hide, and use your environment to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Horror Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Dynamic lighting, disturbing sounds, and a terrifying environment create a constant tension that will keep you on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Escape Routes</strong> \u2013 Choose from various ways to escape the hotel. Will you take the long, safer route, or risk a shorter but more dangerous route?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Mysterious and Shocking Story</strong> \u2013 Discover secret letters, and clues scattered throughout the hotel that will help you understand the hotel\u2019s and the killer\u2019s dark past\u2014and your connection to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Random and Unpredictable Experience</strong> \u2013 Every time you play, the experience will be different. The hallways, rooms, and keys are randomly placed, making each escape attempt challenging and surprising.</p>",
    "short_description": "A tense survival horror game where you must explore a dark, ever-changing hotel, solve puzzles, and evade a relentless killer. Every playthrough is unique, with randomized environments and unpredictable dangers.",
